---
// Hero.astro
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-[120px] pb-20"
  style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1425 0%, #162744 40%, #1a3355 70%, #0f1d35 100%);"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
    <div class="particle"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-10 lg:gap-[60px] items-center relative z-[2]"
    >
      <!-- Left -->
      <div class="text-left max-lg:text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <div
          class="inline-block bg-accent/15 text-accent px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[0.85rem] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-6 border border-accent/20"
          data-i18n="hero_badge"
        >
          Construcții & Inginerie Structurală
        </div>
        <h1
          class="text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.5rem)] max-md:text-[1.8rem] font-black text-white leading-[1.15] mb-6 tracking-tight"
        >
          <span data-i18n="hero_title_1">Construcții Profesionale</span>
          <br /><span
            class="text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-accent to-accent-light bg-clip-text"
            data-i18n="hero_title_2"
            >și Soluții Complete</span
          ><br />
          <span data-i18n="hero_title_3">pentru Proiectul Tău</span>
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-[1.05rem] text-white/75 mb-9 leading-[1.8] max-w-[550px] max-lg:mx-auto"
          data-i18n="hero_desc"
        >
          De la logistică proprie și furnizarea materialelor brute, până la
          proiectarea și execuția sistemelor industriale complexe. Soluții
          integrate sub standarde tehnice riguroase, cu sediul central în Bălți.
        </p>
        <div
          class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap mb-[60px] max-md:flex-col max-md:items-center"
        >
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent to-accent-dark text-primary px-8 py-3.5 font-bold text-[0.95rem] rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 border-none cursor-pointer tracking-tight hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_8px_25px_rgba(240,185,11,0.35)]"
          >
            <span data-i18n="hero_cta_offer">Solicită Ofertă</span>
            <svg
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#servicii"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/10 text-white px-8 py-3.5 font-semibold text-[0.95rem] rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            data-i18n="hero_cta_services"
            >Descoperă Serviciile</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-md:grid-cols-1">
          <div
            class="hero-stat-card hero-stat-card-1 relative backdrop-blur-[20px] border-2 border-white/35 rounded-xl p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] col-span-2 max-md:col-span-1 max-lg:col-span-1"
          >
            <strong
              class="block text-[2.2rem] max-sm:text-[1.8rem] font-extrabold text-accent mb-1.5 tracking-tight"
              >2007</strong
            >
            <span
              class="text-[0.85rem] text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
              data-i18n="stat_founded_label"
              >Anul Fondării</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="hero-stat-card hero-stat-card-2 relative backdrop-blur-[20px] border-2 border-white/35 rounded-xl p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]"
          >
            <strong
              class="block text-[2.2rem] max-sm:text-[1.8rem] font-extrabold text-accent mb-1.5 tracking-tight"
              >200+</strong
            >
            <span
              class="text-[0.85rem] text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
              data-i18n="stat_projects_label"
              >Proiecte Finalizate</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="hero-stat-card hero-stat-card-3 relative backdrop-blur-[20px] border-2 border-white/35 rounded-xl p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]"
          >
            <strong
              class="block text-[2.2rem] max-sm:text-[1.8rem] font-extrabold text-accent mb-1.5 tracking-tight"
              >100%</strong
            >
            <span
              class="text-[0.85rem] text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold"
              data-i18n="stat_clients_label"
              >Clienți Mulțumiți</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="hero-features-bg relative backdrop-blur-[20px] border-2 border-white/35 rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col gap-3.5 overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85 text-[0.95rem] font-medium relative z-[1]"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-accent shrink-0"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span data-i18n="hero_feat_1">Depozite proprii în Bălți</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85 text-[0.95rem] font-medium relative z-[1]"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-accent shrink-0"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span data-i18n="hero_feat_2">Echipă cu 15+ ani experiență</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85 text-[0.95rem] font-medium relative z-[1]"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-accent shrink-0"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span data-i18n="hero_feat_3">Soluții complete la cheie</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-white/30 text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase"
  >
    <div class="w-px h-10 scroll-line bg-white/30"></div>
  </div>
</section>